>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>得<rp>(</rp><rt>どく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个地毯真的买得好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">害</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">伤害；损害；恶劣影响；危害</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192064\">ワインは<ruby>本来<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>害<rp>(</rp><rt>がい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">葡萄酒不会造成任何伤害。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">街</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">街道；街区；地区；区域</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224285\">ここは<ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のビジネス<ruby>街<rp>(</rp><rt>がい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是东京的商业街。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外貨</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外币；外汇；外国汇兑；外国商品；进口商品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200971\">どこで<ruby>外貨<rp>(</rp><rt>がいか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>交換<rp>(</rp><rt>こうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をすることができますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以在哪里交换外汇?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外観</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外观；外表；外貌；看起来的样子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79856\"><ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、その<ruby>本質<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりもむしろ<ruby>外観<rp>(</rp><rt>がいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问题在于它的本质而不是外观。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外交</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外交；推销；上门兜售</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189138\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>外交<rp>(</rp><rt>がいこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>観光<rp>(</rp><rt>かんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>事業<rp>(</rp><rt>じぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>有効<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">英语对外交和旅游业有效。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外国</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいこく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外国；国外</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232163\">あなたは<ruby>外国<rp>(</rp><rt>がいこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你有外国书吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外国人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいこくじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外国人；外国公民；外国国民；外侨；非日本人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211699\">その<ruby>外国人<rp>(</rp><rt>がいこくじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかなりうまく<ruby>日本語<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个外国人说日本语相当好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外出</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいしゅつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外出；出门；离开（住处、办公室等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197683\">ヒーターをつけたまま<ruby>外出<rp>(</rp><rt>がいしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我用加热器走出去。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外相</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外交部长；外相</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">害する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">伤害；损害；危害；杀死；致死；阻碍；妨碍；阻挠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id